ed to protect trailing turnless singletons after the newest closed turn, but the AC wording and tech-design.md Flow 5 still carry the general landing-window phrasing.\"]}]},\"riskAndDeviationReview\":{\"specDeviations\":[{\"description\":\"seedTurnedToolResults is implemented as (sdk, filePath, turns) seeding through a real intake commit, not the test plan's sketched (db, turns) signature: a direct-DB seeder could never fire the production advance (no host-called advance surface exists, per the inherited anti-shim rule), so the fixture drives the production path instead\",\"reasoning\":\"Story implementor surfaced this spec deviation during bounded child execution.\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/003-implementor.json\"],\"approvalStatus\":\"needs-ruling\",\"approvalSource\":null}],\"assumedRisks\":[],\"scopeChanges\":[],\"productionPathDecisionItems\":[{\"description\":\"No fake adapter, shim, placeholder branch, hidden floorTokens fallback, or non-real boundary advance surface was found in the reviewed production files.\",\"reasoning\":\"Story verifier surfaced a production-path audit note. Verifier outcome, open findings, and explicit story-lead risk decisions determine whether action or caller approval is required.\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/004-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/005-verify.json\",\"No fake adapter, shim, placeholder branch, hidden floorTokens fallback, or non-real boundary advance surface was found in the reviewed production files.\"],\"approvalStatus\":\"not-required\",\"approvalSource\":null},{\"description\":\"The prior production-path bug is fixed, but the trail